@startuml
title Step 2: Service &amp; related resource order initiation

participant "Product Order\nDelivery & Orchestration\nManagement" as PODOM
participant "Event Management" as Event #grey
participant "Service Qualification\nManagement" as SQM #blue
participant "Service Catalog\nManagement" as SCM2 #blue
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as SOM #blue
participant "Service Inventory" as SI #blue
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue

== Step 2 ==

PODOM -> SOM : 1 **TMF641 Service Ordering Management**\nPOST /serviceOrder\n(CFSSpecification)
activate SOM
SOM -> SOM : 2 validate CFS order\n(state="acknowledged")
SOM --> PODOM : 3 **TMF641** 201 Created (serviceOrder, state="acknowledged")

PODOM -> PODOM : 4 link productOrderItems and CFSOrderItems

SOM -> SOM : 5 start execution of CFSOrder

group execute CFSOrder orchestration sequence

    SOM -> SOM : 6 update CFSOrderItem (state="inProgress")

    SOM -> Event : 7 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    activate Event
    Event -> PODOM : 8 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    deactivate Event

    SOM -> SQM : 9 **TMF645 Service Qualification Management**\nPOST /checkServiceQualification (CFSSpecification)
    activate SQM
    SQM --> SOM : 10 **TMF645** 201 Created (checkServiceQualification)
    deactivate SQM

    SOM -> SI : 11 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPOST /service (state="feasibilityChecked")
    activate SI
    SI --> SOM : 12 **TMF638** 201 Created (CFS)
    deactivate SI

    SOM -> SCM2 : 13 **TMF633 Service Catalog Management**\nGET /serviceSpecification (CFSSpecification)
    activate SCM2
    SCM2 --> SOM : 14 **TMF633** 200 OK (RFSSpecification)
    deactivate SCM2

    SOM -> SOM : 15 decide between RFS alternatives

    SOM -> SI : 16 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPOST /service (state="feasibilityChecked")
    activate SI
    SI --> SOM : 17 **TMF638** 201 Created (RFS)
    deactivate SI

    SOM -> SCM2 : 18 **TMF633 Service Catalog Management**\nGET /serviceSpecification (RFSSpecification)
    activate SCM2
    SCM2 --> SOM : 19 **TMF633** 200 OK (resourceSpecification)
    deactivate SCM2

    SOM -> SOM : 20 build **resourceOrderItems**

    SOM -> ROM : 21 **TMF652 Resource Order Management**\nPOST /resourceOrder
    activate ROM
    ROM -> ROM : 22 validate resourceOrder
    ROM --> SOM : 23 **TMF652** 201 Created (resourceOrder, state="acknowledged")

    ROM -> ROM : 24 start execution of\nresourceOrder
    note right of ROM : continuation in figure 14
    deactivate ROM

    SOM -> SOM : 25 link serviceOrderItem and **resourceOrderItems**

end
deactivate SOM

@enduml
